        "dialogs": {
          "401060301": {
            "id": "401060301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Well, how did it go? I assume that Lord Sangemah Bay's assistance helped you discover something, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060302"
            ]
          },
          "401060302": {
            "id": "401060302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060303"
            ]
          },
          "401060303": {
            "id": "401060303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Sachin was not a good person, and there's definitely something wrong with that Diadem of Knowledge!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060306"
            ]
          },
          "401060306": {
            "id": "401060306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Then in that case, shouldn't you be doing something about it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060307"
            ]
          },
          "401060307": {
            "id": "401060307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "For instance, telling the Akademiya that they should give up the Diadem—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060308"
            ]
          },
          "401060308": {
            "id": "401060308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We already told the Akademiya, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060309"
            ]
          },
          "401060309": {
            "id": "401060309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "But what?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060310"
            ]
          },
          "401060310": {
            "id": "401060310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Kaveh smashed the diadem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060311"
            ]
          },
          "401060311": {
            "id": "401060311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Whaaaaat!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060312"
            ]
          },
          "401060312": {
            "id": "401060312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Calm down, Dori! Why are you getting so worked up?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060313"
            ]
          },
          "401060313": {
            "id": "401060313",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060314"
            ]
          },
          "401060314": {
            "id": "401060314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "My diadem... My beautiful diadem...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060315"
            ]
          },
          "401060315": {
            "id": "401060315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "Ah, this was supposed to be the perfect plan! I feed you the information, you discover the issue with the diadem, and then I just wait until the Akademiya sells it off at a low price...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060316"
            ]
          },
          "401060316": {
            "id": "401060316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "And now it was all for nothing! Grr, curse that Kaveh! The interest rate on the Mora he owes me is about to get much higher!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060317"
            ]
          },
          "401060317": {
            "id": "401060317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ohhh, so that's why you told us about this. Yeah, Paimon did think you were being unusually generous...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401060318"
            ]
          },
          "401060318": {
            "id": "401060318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dori",
            "text": "My diadem! Ugh, I'm furious! That's it, no extension on his payment this month, no matter what reason he gives!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
